          "settings": {
            "heading": "OUR MISSION",
            "heading_size": "ts-text-clamp_l"
          }
        },
        "text_fNegBJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At HEAL In COLOUR, our mission is to promote inclusivity and representation in everyday essentials. We believe everyone deserves to feel seen, valued, and confident in their healing journey. Our bandages are designed to blend seamlessly with Black and Brown skin tones, honoring the unique beauty of all individuals.<\/p>"
