    "image_with_text_9i6gHq": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_wwiq9D": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HEAL IN COLOUR BRAND",
            "heading_size": "ts-text-clamp_l"
          }
        },
        "text_bfUx6A": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We are revolutionizing the way people shop for bandages.  We want to create a world where black and brown bandages are the norm.  We will build long-term relationships with customers based on integrity and a dedication to excellence by offering the highest quality brown and black bandages, made from premium materials, at a competitive price.\u2028<\/p><p>Our main focus is to find opportunities to create a superior experience for all households, schools and health care.  We will accomplish this by continually being trailblazers in the industry with innovation and strategic planning.  <\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "use_color": true,
            "text_color": "#000000"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_wwiq9D",
        "text_bfUx6A"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
